# W4 round 3: the cut inside a running turn, on fx (`compact-inturn-fx.cap` and
# `compact-inturn-xfx.cap` differ only in their workspace: three logs of 160 lines,
# sized so the turn's request crosses the compaction point after its third read
# on this product -- fx previews a long read, xfx sends it whole). A 16 250-token
# window keeping 2 000 for output: 14 250 usable, compacting at 11 400. The short
# first turn is what reads xfx's catalog before the long one.
gateway compact-inturn-turns.json
models compact-inturn-models.json
work compact-inturn-fx-ws
wait 3
type hello
key Enter
wait 3
type read the logs
key Enter
wait 1.2
snap compacting
wait 4
snap answered
gwlog
